# Five Towns Garage Door — Netlify _redirects
# (Cloudflare Pages honours the two path rules below but ignores host-level rules;
#  on Cloudflare use "Always Use HTTPS" + a www->apex Redirect Rule instead.)
# Legacy URLs go straight to their final HTTPS non-www destination (single hop, no chains).
/contact.php    https://fivetownsgaragedoor.com/contact.html    301!
/error.html     https://fivetownsgaragedoor.com/index.html      301!

# Canonical host: HTTPS + non-www, path preserved.
# (Netlify also enforces HTTPS automatically once the certificate is provisioned.)
http://www.fivetownsgaragedoor.com/*   https://fivetownsgaragedoor.com/:splat   301!
https://www.fivetownsgaragedoor.com/*  https://fivetownsgaragedoor.com/:splat   301!
http://fivetownsgaragedoor.com/*       https://fivetownsgaragedoor.com/:splat   301!

# NOTE: "/" and "/index.html" are both served directly (200). Do NOT add a rule
# between them — that would create a loop. Legacy .html URLs are never rewritten.
